From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:29:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: vfe: Add support for VFE 980

Add support for the VFE (Video Front End) 980 found on SM8750 SoC.
The bus register base of the lite VFEs starts at 0x200 and that of the
full VFEs at 0x800.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261114-add-support-for-camss-on-sm8750-v7-11-8ff2a11835f6@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Wenmeng Liu <wenmeng.liu@oss.qualcomm.com>
